      "message": "It is because realtek supports proprietary GET_PDO and the proprietary one supports retrieving all the PDOs in one shot while TI doesn\u0027t have similar API. Currently pdc_power_mgmt is implemented based on realtek\u0027s proprietary GET_PDO API. We could change the implementation if we prefer using UCSI across all PDCs.",
